# DIAGNOSTICS

A source error names its file and line, those of the source before preprocessing: `dtc: soc.dtsi:12: no node labelled 'uart9'`, `expected ';'`, a value that doesn't fit its cells, and it exits 1; `dtc: the preprocessor failed on <file>`.

# BUGS

`/memreserve/` and `/plugin/` (overlays) are refused.
Labels on values and properties are read and dropped, and the tree has no `__symbols__`.
